# Cursor Model Pin

When calling `Task` or launching subagents, set `model` to `cursor-grok-4.5-high` only (or omit `model` so custom-agent frontmatter wins).

Do not pass Claude, GPT, Composer, Terra, or Sol model slugs.

Custom agents under `.cursor/agents/` are pinned to `cursor-grok-4.5-high`.
